    "description": "<p><strong>Deities</strong> Any</p>\n<p>Your deity inspires you with hope that wayward members of your faith can be brought back into the fold.</p>\n<p><strong>Granted Powers:</strong> You reach out to your misguided fellows and give them every chance to turn back from conflict with the true faith, even if your differences come to violence.</p>",
